WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:36.709
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:36.979 --> 01:38.840
[The Lament of Autumn]

3
01:39.280 --> 01:41.770
[Episode 3]

4
01:52.370 --> 01:52.930
Dad,

5
01:53.289 --> 01:54.870
I'll go prepare your medicine first.

6
01:54.870 --> 01:56.930
Please get some rest after taking it.

7
01:57.710 --> 01:59.479
Once you're feeling better,

8
02:00.200 --> 02:01.060
we'll find a way

9
02:01.310 --> 02:02.440
to leave this place.

10
02:04.480 --> 02:05.040
Dad.

11
02:05.920 --> 02:06.480
Dad.

12
02:24.690 --> 02:26.620
When did you two start conspiring?

13
02:30.810 --> 02:32.670
I haven't conspired with anyone.

14
02:35.120 --> 02:36.740
You deliberately made that bet

15
02:36.740 --> 02:37.810
to stall for time.

16
02:38.500 --> 02:39.520
Where is Feng Yao,

17
02:39.520 --> 02:40.740
the one you helped escape?

18
02:40.740 --> 02:42.270
What else are you planning?

19
02:42.620 --> 02:44.150
Who's pulling the strings?

20
02:46.470 --> 02:48.670
I don't know what you're talking about.

21
02:51.770 --> 02:55.370
You're familiar with these instruments of torture, aren't you?

22
03:42.410 --> 03:43.940
Are you going to talk or not?

23
03:45.630 --> 03:47.030
What do you want me to say?

24
03:47.810 --> 03:49.079
I don't know anything.

25
03:49.370 --> 03:51.079
Are you torturing me to force a confession,

26
03:51.079 --> 03:53.740
expecting me to lie and falsely accuse someone?

27
04:07.710 --> 04:09.710
That girl has had a hard life.

28
04:09.870 --> 04:11.020
It's just her

29
04:11.130 --> 04:12.240
and her seriously ill father at home.

30
04:12.240 --> 04:13.960
They only have each other.

31
04:14.360 --> 04:15.690
My entire family of five

32
04:17.050 --> 04:19.260
was killed by Yu Changxuan.

33
04:19.690 --> 04:21.690
Even if it costs me my life,

34
04:22.190 --> 04:24.500
I'll make him pay in blood.

35
04:39.180 --> 04:40.120
Let's see

36
04:41.000 --> 04:43.060
how long you can keep your mouth shut.

37
04:52.130 --> 04:52.680
Miss Ye,

38
04:54.300 --> 04:55.900
think of your mother at home.

39
04:56.070 --> 04:57.800
Why put yourself through this?

40
05:07.720 --> 05:09.270
I'll ask you one last time.

41
05:23.570 --> 05:26.570
Fifth Young Master Yu, someone has turned herself in.

42
05:38.240 --> 05:39.220
Feng Yao.

43
05:52.250 --> 05:52.680
I never expected you

44
05:52.680 --> 05:54.250
to turn yourself in.

45
05:55.860 --> 05:57.510
I wanted to kill an evil man.

46
05:58.480 --> 05:59.880
I've done nothing wrong.

47
06:00.810 --> 06:02.470
Why call it turning myself in?

48
06:03.360 --> 06:04.300
Even if I had

49
06:04.300 --> 06:06.220
only the slimmest chance,

50
06:07.950 --> 06:09.100
I'd still kill you.

51
06:09.860 --> 06:11.060
You hate me that much?

52
06:11.990 --> 06:13.920
What grudge do you have against me?

53
06:14.860 --> 06:15.720
My father

54
06:16.930 --> 06:18.930
spent his life practicing medicine

55
06:19.370 --> 06:20.720
and helping others.

56
06:21.300 --> 06:23.560
He often treated villagers for free.

57
06:24.270 --> 06:25.070
He was a good,

58
06:25.100 --> 06:27.070
law-abiding man.

59
06:27.540 --> 06:29.120
But because he failed to save

60
06:29.120 --> 06:30.770
a gravely wounded officer,

61
06:31.040 --> 06:33.600
your army ordered his execution

62
06:34.500 --> 06:35.830
and condemned my entire family

63
06:35.830 --> 06:36.890
to die with him.

64
06:37.159 --> 06:40.000
Now tell me, what grudge do you think I have against you?

65
06:40.000 --> 06:41.200
The hatred between us

66
06:42.659 --> 06:44.060
can never be reconciled.

67
06:51.600 --> 06:52.659
You've forgotten.

68
06:55.740 --> 06:57.310
You've forgotten all of it!

69
06:57.800 --> 07:00.560
You claim Fifth Young Master Yu ordered your whole family killed.

70
07:00.560 --> 07:01.190
Then how did you

71
07:01.190 --> 07:02.590
and your father survive?

72
07:11.690 --> 07:13.180
Those soldiers

73
07:15.160 --> 07:17.560
abused me for three whole days and nights.

74
07:19.100 --> 07:21.630
That's how I managed to save my father's life.

75
07:23.390 --> 07:25.250
But his lung was pierced,

76
07:26.500 --> 07:29.120
and he endured a living hell.

77
07:30.600 --> 07:31.600
Are you satisfied

78
07:33.770 --> 07:35.070
with that answer?

79
07:36.000 --> 07:37.460
I never gave such an order.

80
07:37.720 --> 07:38.560
Shameless.

81
07:41.420 --> 07:42.390
You dare commit such atrocities

82
07:42.390 --> 07:43.970
but won't admit it?

83
07:44.300 --> 07:45.800
I read the newspaper.

84
07:46.560 --> 07:48.390
You were on the front page,

85
07:48.750 --> 07:50.220
being honored

86
07:50.220 --> 07:52.550
for your service as a commanding officer.

87
07:52.659 --> 07:54.600
You were the one who gave the order.

88
08:01.120 --> 08:02.420
Fifth Young Master Yu

89
08:02.420 --> 08:04.070
could put a bullet in you right now.

90
08:04.070 --> 08:06.240
He has no reason to waste his time lying to you.

91
08:06.240 --> 08:07.010
That unit

92
08:07.070 --> 08:09.310
wasn't under Fifth Young Master Yu's command.

93
08:09.310 --> 08:10.450
The commander took credit

94
08:10.450 --> 08:11.790
for others' military achievements

95
08:11.790 --> 08:13.160
and passed them off

96
08:13.160 --> 08:14.690
as Fifth Young Master Yu's.

97
08:24.190 --> 08:25.000
Impossible.

98
08:25.660 --> 08:26.500
Impossible.

99
08:27.340 --> 08:28.360
Impossible!

100
08:29.300 --> 08:30.500
Impossible...

101
08:31.300 --> 08:32.289
Impossible...

102
08:42.460 --> 08:43.390
Here's the deal:

103
08:45.590 --> 08:47.250
tell me who's behind all this,

104
08:48.290 --> 08:49.530
and I might consider

105
08:50.100 --> 08:51.720
sparing you and your father.

106
08:58.010 --> 08:59.010
Feng Yao,

107
09:01.460 --> 09:03.320
just tell him what you know.

108
09:05.480 --> 09:07.010
You still have your father.

109
09:10.150 --> 09:11.500
Not anymore.

110
09:13.600 --> 09:14.570
Pingjun,

111
09:16.670 --> 09:18.270
it's too late.

112
09:21.500 --> 09:22.510
My father...

113
09:25.220 --> 09:26.500
is already gone.

114
09:29.890 --> 09:30.700
Dad!

115
09:31.000 --> 09:31.790
Dad.

116
09:31.840 --> 09:33.010
Dad, wake up.

117
09:33.550 --> 09:34.200
Dad!

118
09:34.530 --> 09:35.720
Dad, wake up.

119
09:36.050 --> 09:37.700
I... I got your medicine.

120
09:37.700 --> 09:38.390
The doctor said...

121
09:38.390 --> 09:39.720
The doctor said you'd get better if you took your medicine.

122
09:39.720 --> 09:40.250
Dad,

123
09:40.290 --> 09:41.200
I'm getting your medicine.

124
09:41.200 --> 09:41.790
Dad.

125
09:43.000 --> 09:43.720
The doctor said

126
09:43.720 --> 09:45.500
you'd get better once you took it.

127
09:45.500 --> 09:46.590
The doctor said...

128
09:46.890 --> 09:49.100
The doctor said you'd get better if you took your medicine.

129
09:49.100 --> 09:49.720
Dad...

130
09:51.000 --> 09:51.790
Dad!

131
09:53.200 --> 09:54.790
I have no family

132
09:57.700 --> 09:59.340
left in this world.

133
10:18.340 --> 10:19.390
I came here

134
10:24.120 --> 10:26.520
because I didn't want to drag you into this.

135
10:46.970 --> 10:51.480
[Treating Men and Women of All Ages: Internal and External Medicine]

136
11:31.610 --> 11:32.710
Thank you

137
11:34.630 --> 11:35.840
for letting me see

138
11:36.840 --> 11:38.300
my family together again,

139
11:42.030 --> 11:44.130
all in one place.

140
12:02.250 --> 12:03.010
Feng Yao!

141
12:07.500 --> 12:08.460
Feng Yao.

142
12:08.740 --> 12:09.410
Feng Yao.

143
12:11.130 --> 12:12.960
I truly don't know

144
12:13.320 --> 12:14.980
who's behind all this.

145
12:18.430 --> 12:19.330
I'm sorry,

146
12:22.840 --> 12:23.630
Pingjun.

147
12:26.250 --> 12:27.960
I dragged you into this.

148
12:34.130 --> 12:35.630
At least

149
12:37.270 --> 12:38.980
I'll soon

150
12:39.740 --> 12:41.400
be free of all this suffering.

151
12:58.940 --> 12:59.740
Feng Yao.

152
13:20.510 --> 13:21.510
You may leave now.

153
13:55.600 --> 13:56.250
Get in.

154
14:07.240 --> 14:08.030
Get in,

155
14:09.790 --> 14:11.590
or go back to jail and stay there.

156
14:16.340 --> 14:18.340
She was a living, breathing person,

157
14:20.170 --> 14:22.030
and she died right in front of you.

158
14:27.440 --> 14:29.040
She tried to assassinate me.

159
14:30.360 --> 14:32.690
She deserved to die a thousand times over.

160
14:45.650 --> 14:46.290
The money.

161
14:55.820 --> 14:56.680
You won the bet,

162
14:57.820 --> 14:58.620
you saint.

163
15:12.630 --> 15:13.480
You bastard!

164
15:39.250 --> 15:41.580
Do you really want to get yourself killed?

165
15:47.790 --> 15:49.400
She nearly got you killed,

166
15:49.420 --> 15:51.280
and you're still taking her side.

167
15:58.100 --> 15:59.790
Don't you get it yet?

168
16:02.870 --> 16:03.720
I don't.

169
16:05.000 --> 16:05.800
Enlighten me.

170
16:13.210 --> 16:14.540
People like you

171
16:16.290 --> 16:18.340
are born above everyone else,

172
16:19.790 --> 16:20.770
looking down on ordinary people

173
16:20.770 --> 16:23.500
as if they're nothing but ants beneath your feet.

174
16:24.840 --> 16:26.970
You don't understand their suffering

175
16:28.290 --> 16:29.860
or care about their pain.

176
16:29.880 --> 16:30.770
How could you ever understand

177
16:30.770 --> 16:33.770
why they're willing to risk their lives to fight back?

178
16:50.000 --> 16:50.940
Don't forget,

179
16:51.360 --> 16:53.090
you can go home safely tonight,

180
16:54.600 --> 16:57.770
care for your mom and help her get the medicine and treatment she needs,

181
16:57.770 --> 16:58.840
and go to school

182
16:59.770 --> 17:02.130
tomorrow morning,

183
17:03.670 --> 17:05.329
all because

184
17:05.500 --> 17:07.640
we protect this land.

185
17:10.589 --> 17:11.720
Without us,

186
17:12.750 --> 17:14.280
many more people would die.

187
17:23.329 --> 17:25.390
You oppress the people like a tyrant,

188
17:30.330 --> 17:33.260
yet you actually think you're their guardian angel.

189
17:38.830 --> 17:40.720
We common folk

190
17:42.590 --> 17:44.330
are truly honored

191
17:47.590 --> 17:49.440
to have your protection.

192
18:27.530 --> 18:28.990
Now, that's interesting.

193
19:15.900 --> 19:16.700
Let me go!

194
19:17.070 --> 19:17.880
Let me go!

195
19:39.960 --> 19:40.750
Commander,

196
19:41.290 --> 19:43.030
I swear I didn't do it!

197
19:43.940 --> 19:44.420
He's

198
19:44.420 --> 19:45.920
an antique dealer.

199
19:46.050 --> 19:46.960
He said he had some valuable pieces

200
19:46.960 --> 19:48.360
he couldn't sell openly,

201
19:48.480 --> 19:49.250
so I met him

202
19:49.250 --> 19:50.400
in private.

203
19:53.660 --> 19:55.160
Was it really just an antique deal?

204
19:55.160 --> 19:56.140
N-No!

205
19:56.140 --> 19:56.800
I'm just...

206
19:57.030 --> 19:57.830
I'm just a courier

207
19:57.830 --> 19:58.960
delivering bank drafts for cashing.

208
19:58.960 --> 19:59.940
Officer Liao said

209
19:59.940 --> 20:01.180
that any inside information

210
20:01.180 --> 20:02.000
comes at a price.

211
20:02.000 --> 20:03.170
You're crazy!

212
20:03.240 --> 20:04.900
Why are you framing me?

213
20:05.550 --> 20:06.410
Liao Dongfeng,

214
20:08.010 --> 20:09.410
how do you explain these?

215
20:09.740 --> 20:11.070
how do you explain them?

216
20:13.920 --> 20:16.030
Before the assassination attempt on Fifth Young Master Yu,

217
20:16.030 --> 20:17.640
100,000 silver dollars were deposited

218
20:17.640 --> 20:18.810
into your bank account

219
20:18.810 --> 20:20.470
by someone from the Mu family.

220
20:20.920 --> 20:21.720
Commander,

221
20:22.200 --> 20:23.940
I had no idea!

222
20:25.000 --> 20:25.860
Liao Dongfeng,

223
20:27.140 --> 20:30.070
was my son's life worth only 100,000 silver dollars?

224
20:30.900 --> 20:31.700
Commander,

225
20:32.550 --> 20:34.970
why won't you believe me?

226
20:35.330 --> 20:37.440
How could I possibly kill Fifth Young Master Yu?

227
20:37.440 --> 20:40.350
I wouldn't dare!

228
20:44.610 --> 20:46.010
Commander...

229
20:47.610 --> 20:49.540
I'll take good care of your family.

230
20:52.110 --> 20:53.220
Go in peace.

231
20:54.070 --> 20:54.880
Commander...

232
20:57.420 --> 20:58.180
Commander!

233
20:59.030 --> 21:00.180
Commander!

234
21:00.640 --> 21:02.150
Commander!

235
21:02.310 --> 21:03.110
Commander...

236
21:03.480 --> 21:04.770
I'm innocent!

237
21:04.810 --> 21:07.740
Commander, save me!

238
21:08.220 --> 21:09.250
Commander!

239
21:10.920 --> 21:12.140
Commander...

240
21:12.220 --> 21:14.690
I'm innocent, Commander!

241
21:14.770 --> 21:17.160
Commander, save me!

242
21:30.850 --> 21:32.140
People like you

243
21:32.920 --> 21:35.060
are born above everyone else,

244
21:35.200 --> 21:36.270
looking down on ordinary people

245
21:36.270 --> 21:38.830
as if they're nothing but ants beneath your feet.

246
21:38.830 --> 21:40.960
You don't understand their suffering

247
21:41.900 --> 21:43.290
or care about their pain.

248
21:43.290 --> 21:44.250
How could you ever understand

249
21:44.250 --> 21:47.250
why they're willing to risk their lives to fight back?

250
21:53.350 --> 21:57.100
[Guanyin Pavilion]

251
21:57.420 --> 22:00.970
[Memorial Tablet of My Late Brother, Yu Mingxuan]

252
22:05.730 --> 22:09.870
[Memorial Tablet of My Late Brother, Yu Mingxuan]

253
22:21.460 --> 22:22.790
It's finally finished.

254
22:27.110 --> 22:28.140
Mingxuan,

255
22:28.500 --> 22:30.350
you've recreated

256
22:30.590 --> 22:31.500
so many architectural models

257
22:31.500 --> 22:32.830
based on ancient texts.

258
22:33.510 --> 22:35.610
When are you going to build a real one?

259
22:37.850 --> 22:38.900
Actually, this isn't what I most

260
22:38.900 --> 22:39.740
want to build.

261
22:39.960 --> 22:42.220
Then what do you want to build, Mingxuan?

262
22:43.570 --> 22:44.380
Changxuan,

263
22:45.350 --> 22:46.960
the peace we enjoy today

264
22:47.980 --> 22:50.110
is thanks to our family's protection.

265
22:50.740 --> 22:52.140
In these troubled times,

266
22:52.660 --> 22:53.920
the land is in turmoil,

267
22:54.320 --> 22:55.720
and the people are suffering.

268
22:55.720 --> 22:56.590
So many have

269
22:57.240 --> 22:58.980
no place to call home.

270
23:01.050 --> 23:01.740
We mustn't

271
23:01.740 --> 23:02.870
let our good fortune

272
23:03.880 --> 23:06.410
blind us to the suffering of ordinary people.

273
23:07.330 --> 23:08.010
Remember,

274
23:09.180 --> 23:10.960
the most beautiful buildings

275
23:11.510 --> 23:14.050
are those that let people live and work in peace

276
23:14.050 --> 23:15.110
and give them

277
23:15.850 --> 23:17.180
a lifetime of security.

278
23:21.680 --> 23:22.480
Yu Mingxuan,

279
23:25.250 --> 23:25.810
someone

280
23:25.810 --> 23:27.540
said the same thing to me today.

281
23:28.110 --> 23:29.290
She said

282
23:30.640 --> 23:33.640
I don't understand the suffering of ordinary people,

283
23:36.110 --> 23:37.530
that I can't

284
23:37.530 --> 23:38.660
feel their pain.

285
23:49.110 --> 23:50.770
Of course I don't understand.

286
23:54.180 --> 23:56.110
You died before you could teach me.

287
23:56.660 --> 23:59.770
[Memorial Tablet of My Late Brother, Yu Mingxuan]

288
24:01.170 --> 24:04.030
All I've ever known is what it means to be abandoned,

289
24:05.240 --> 24:08.240
to be treated without a shred of affection or loyalty.

290
24:08.610 --> 24:09.640
So was I wrong?

291
24:11.180 --> 24:13.860
[Memorial Tablet of My Late Brother, Yu Mingxuan]

292
24:23.380 --> 24:24.240
I wasn't wrong.

293
25:26.710 --> 25:27.690
Did I wake you?

294
25:28.440 --> 25:30.170
You're moving around too much.

295
25:30.400 --> 25:31.200
I can't sleep.

296
25:32.850 --> 25:34.110
I'll be gentler, then.

297
27:48.550 --> 27:49.350
Wanqiao,

298
27:51.030 --> 27:52.230
I've told you before:

299
27:54.830 --> 27:55.900
in this family,

300
27:57.240 --> 27:58.140
never overstep

301
27:59.640 --> 28:00.680
your bounds.

302
28:30.270 --> 28:33.160
[Minde Girls' High School]

303
28:38.270 --> 28:40.510
This letter comes a little late.

304
28:41.570 --> 28:44.250
I've picked up my pen several times, only to put it down again.

305
28:44.250 --> 28:46.010
So much has happened lately.

306
28:46.700 --> 28:48.300
I hardly know where to begin.

307
28:49.440 --> 28:51.040
For the first time in my life,

308
28:51.500 --> 28:53.070
I've truly witnessed

309
28:53.070 --> 28:54.790
a life slipping away.

310
28:57.590 --> 28:58.400
Xueting,

311
28:59.600 --> 29:01.180
[Minde Girls' High School]

312
28:59.850 --> 29:01.110
how did the world

313
29:01.620 --> 29:02.080
[Minde Girls' High School]

314
29:01.830 --> 29:03.330
come to this?

315
29:07.260 --> 29:09.520
[Xiangxi Hotel]

316
29:28.830 --> 29:29.330
Hello, Master Jin.

317
29:29.330 --> 29:30.390
Hello, Master Jin.

318
29:32.310 --> 29:32.970
Master Jin.

319
29:34.440 --> 29:35.240
Master Jin.

320
29:37.460 --> 29:38.550
Good day, Master Jin.

321
29:38.550 --> 29:39.530
Good day, Master Jin.

322
29:39.530 --> 29:40.190
Master Jin.

323
29:42.110 --> 29:42.770
Master Jin.

324
29:43.570 --> 29:45.030
Mr. Wang, long time no see.

325
29:45.550 --> 29:47.270
I was in Guangzhou for a couple of days.

326
29:47.270 --> 29:48.250
As soon as I got back to Nanhuai,

327
29:48.250 --> 29:49.240
I came straight over

328
29:49.240 --> 29:50.460
to see you.

329
29:51.180 --> 29:52.380
Speaking of Guangzhou,

330
29:52.380 --> 29:53.140
we've got

331
29:53.160 --> 29:54.140
a new chef here

332
29:54.500 --> 29:56.240
who specializes in Cantonese cuisine.

333
29:56.240 --> 29:58.240
The new chef is great at making soup.

334
29:58.550 --> 29:59.680
You're a regular here,

335
29:59.680 --> 30:01.000
so do come by more often.

336
30:01.000 --> 30:02.440
Then I'll have to give it a try.

337
30:02.440 --> 30:03.720
All right, I'll let you get back to work.

338
30:03.720 --> 30:04.880
All right, I'd better get back to it.

339
30:04.880 --> 30:05.680
It's at the...

340
30:05.680 --> 30:06.740
Where was it again?

341
30:07.350 --> 30:08.050
Master Jin.

342
30:08.070 --> 30:09.660
-Long time no see. -Master Jin.

343
30:09.660 --> 30:10.420
Sorry we haven't taken better care of you.

344
30:10.420 --> 30:11.010
Keep him company.

345
30:11.010 --> 30:11.610
All right.

346
30:11.960 --> 30:14.490
-Good day, Master Jin. -Good day, Master Jin.

347
30:23.020 --> 30:24.420
All right, it's a deal.

348
30:31.330 --> 30:31.990
Changxuan.

349
30:32.530 --> 30:32.880
Following the clues

350
30:32.880 --> 30:34.080
Feng Yao left behind,

351
30:34.610 --> 30:36.590
we tracked down the accomplices in the assassination attempt.

352
30:36.590 --> 30:38.390
They're all death-row convicts

353
30:40.680 --> 30:41.610
from Chihua.

354
30:45.220 --> 30:46.160
So

355
30:48.660 --> 30:50.250
Mu Linsen was behind it.

356
30:51.660 --> 30:53.060
There's something else.

357
30:53.500 --> 30:56.500
The Commander had Liao Dongfeng executed last night.

358
31:06.300 --> 31:08.750
So the old man knew all along

359
31:09.810 --> 31:11.740
that Mu Linsen was the mastermind,

360
31:13.510 --> 31:15.010
and he personally buried

361
31:16.250 --> 31:17.960
the leads about the guns.

362
31:22.510 --> 31:24.310
The Commander wouldn't do that, surely.

363
31:24.310 --> 31:26.440
This concerns your safety, after all.

364
31:30.210 --> 31:31.360
If word gets out,

365
31:32.420 --> 31:34.950
the old generals opposed to the allied forces

366
31:35.180 --> 31:37.110
will have even more reservations.

367
31:38.980 --> 31:40.310
To the old man,

368
31:40.660 --> 31:42.790
the allied forces come above all else.

369
31:43.460 --> 31:44.660
How could my safety

370
31:47.420 --> 31:49.280
get in the way of his rise to power?

371
32:02.160 --> 32:03.420
By the way, Changxuan,

372
32:04.160 --> 32:05.660
the men who killed Feng Yao's family

373
32:05.660 --> 32:06.900
were bandits recruited by Brigade Commander Kuang

374
32:06.900 --> 32:07.980
three years ago.

375
32:09.110 --> 32:10.680
Does my brother-in-law know?

376
32:10.680 --> 32:11.250
Yes.

377
32:11.720 --> 32:13.310
When they were first recruited,

378
32:13.310 --> 32:14.940
Brigade Commander Kuang spared them punishment

379
32:14.940 --> 32:16.400
to keep the troops in line.

380
32:18.350 --> 32:19.610
Those animals

381
32:20.850 --> 32:22.380
have no place in the Yu Army.

382
32:23.660 --> 32:26.660
Arrest them all and deal with them under military law.

383
32:26.930 --> 32:27.690
Understood.

384
32:48.640 --> 32:49.310
Changxuan.

385
32:48.680 --> 32:52.290
[Vision and Wisdom Beyond Measure]

386
32:51.510 --> 32:52.810
You're finally back.

387
32:52.870 --> 32:54.400
I've been waiting for you for ages.

388
32:54.400 --> 32:55.960
What scheme are you cooking up this time?

389
32:55.960 --> 32:57.020
Nothing like that.

390
32:57.890 --> 32:59.900
I came all this way just to tell you

391
33:00.880 --> 33:01.590
Dad's back.

392
33:02.290 --> 33:03.550
Fifth Young Master Yu.

393
33:04.750 --> 33:05.740
Fifth Young Master Yu,

394
33:05.740 --> 33:08.270
the Commander is waiting for you in his study.

395
33:20.590 --> 33:22.250
That brat Changxuan

396
33:22.510 --> 33:23.090
is back,

397
33:23.090 --> 33:25.220
yet I can't even catch a glimpse of him.

398
33:25.310 --> 33:26.070
You won't let him

399
33:26.070 --> 33:28.000
get involved in military affairs.

400
33:28.250 --> 33:30.350
No wonder he spends his days idle,

401
33:30.510 --> 33:32.700
looking for something to occupy his time.

402
33:32.700 --> 33:34.830
It's not as if I never gave him a chance.

403
33:35.110 --> 33:38.440
-Have you forgotten the trouble he caused? -Didn't we agree

404
33:38.570 --> 33:40.070
not to bring up the past?

405
33:42.550 --> 33:43.680
Dad. Mom.

406
33:48.610 --> 33:51.270
Mind your manners when you speak to your father.

407
33:58.010 --> 33:59.610
I called you here to tell you

408
34:00.050 --> 34:01.070
that the assassination case

409
34:01.070 --> 34:02.460
has been solved.

410
34:03.960 --> 34:05.770
Liao Dongfeng betrayed us,

411
34:06.460 --> 34:07.960
selling information

412
34:07.960 --> 34:09.320
to an old enemy I made

413
34:09.320 --> 34:11.449
while suppressing bandits years ago.

414
34:11.670 --> 34:13.130
I've dealt with him.

415
34:16.730 --> 34:17.880
I see.

416
34:23.380 --> 34:24.780
You've worked hard, Dad.

417
34:27.110 --> 34:28.170
All these years,

418
34:29.650 --> 34:31.460
I've never seen you

419
34:33.030 --> 34:35.030
take such an interest in my affairs.

420
34:35.760 --> 34:37.110
Are you insulting me

421
34:37.110 --> 34:38.230
or praising me?

422
34:41.380 --> 34:42.440
I'm touched.

423
34:46.230 --> 34:48.320
For the first time, I can see clearly

424
34:49.360 --> 34:51.159
that there's still a place for me

425
34:52.280 --> 34:53.440
in your heart.

426
35:01.280 --> 35:05.700
[Yu's Residence]

427
35:10.880 --> 35:11.680
One last bite.

428
35:18.550 --> 35:19.110
Mom,

429
35:19.320 --> 35:21.120
I think you look much better now.

430
35:21.150 --> 35:22.010
In a little while,

431
35:22.010 --> 35:24.210
I'll take you out to enjoy the sunshine.

432
35:24.880 --> 35:25.610
Okay.

433
35:26.280 --> 35:27.610
Whatever you say, dear.

434
35:28.820 --> 35:29.610
Pingjun!

435
35:31.110 --> 35:31.960
Pingjun!

436
35:32.670 --> 35:33.530
Hello, Auntie.

437
35:34.050 --> 35:35.010
Why are you here?

438
35:35.260 --> 35:37.060
To visit your mother, of course.

439
35:39.570 --> 35:40.420
Auntie.

440
35:42.780 --> 35:44.240
These flowers are for you.

441
35:45.030 --> 35:46.290
They're so beautiful.

442
35:46.820 --> 35:47.880
Thank you, Hanzhi.

443
35:48.900 --> 35:50.500
I'll get you a glass of water.

444
35:51.230 --> 35:51.900
Auntie,

445
35:52.320 --> 35:53.780
could I ask you for a favor?

446
35:54.440 --> 35:55.150
Go ahead.

447
35:56.230 --> 35:58.290
Would you lend Pingjun to me for a day?

448
35:58.570 --> 35:59.630
My cousin is having

449
35:59.630 --> 36:00.860
an important family dinner today,

450
36:00.860 --> 36:02.480
and I need someone to accompany me.

451
36:02.480 --> 36:03.920
Please let Pingjun come along

452
36:03.920 --> 36:05.250
and have some fun, okay?

453
36:05.690 --> 36:06.320
Here.

454
36:07.070 --> 36:08.080
I can't do that.

455
36:08.110 --> 36:10.090
I have to stay and take care of my mom.

456
36:10.090 --> 36:11.150
Auntie...

457
36:13.150 --> 36:14.150
Just go.

458
36:14.840 --> 36:16.510
I'm feeling much better now.

459
36:16.960 --> 36:17.960
Besides,

460
36:18.460 --> 36:20.420
Hanzhi has asked so nicely.

461
36:20.650 --> 36:21.780
You wouldn't want to

462
36:22.090 --> 36:24.750
turn her down and make her feel slighted, right?

463
36:28.110 --> 36:29.510
Just come with me.

464
36:29.840 --> 36:31.840
My cousin will send someone to pick us up.

465
36:31.840 --> 36:33.130
We'll be driven there and back.

466
36:33.130 --> 36:34.510
It won't take much time.

467
36:35.170 --> 36:36.360
Just go with her.

468
36:36.840 --> 36:37.960
I'm really fine.

469
36:42.570 --> 36:43.430
Alright, then.

470
36:47.010 --> 36:47.880
Cousin.

471
36:48.500 --> 36:49.650
Mission accomplished.

472
36:49.650 --> 36:50.980
I've brought her to you.

473
36:52.550 --> 36:54.500
This is my classmate, Pingjun.

474
36:54.960 --> 36:55.670
I

475
36:55.670 --> 36:56.130
don't know

476
36:56.130 --> 36:57.320
what got into him yesterday,

477
36:57.320 --> 36:58.840
but he insisted that none of my classmates

478
36:58.840 --> 37:00.780
could compare to the socialites he knows.

479
37:00.780 --> 37:02.880
I was so annoyed that I mentioned you to him.

480
37:02.880 --> 37:04.130
Did I say that?

481
37:05.650 --> 37:07.150
Nice to meet you, Miss Ye.

482
37:08.880 --> 37:09.360
Bowen.

483
37:09.550 --> 37:10.010
Come on.

484
37:11.150 --> 37:12.010
Excuse me.

485
37:13.000 --> 37:13.510
Miss Ye,

486
37:13.610 --> 37:14.630
let me introduce you.

487
37:14.630 --> 37:15.920
This is my older sister,

488
37:15.920 --> 37:17.440
Li Bowen.

489
37:18.550 --> 37:19.680
Pleased to meet you.

490
37:20.050 --> 37:21.850
You're even lovelier in person.

491
37:21.960 --> 37:22.850
Miss Ye,

492
37:23.360 --> 37:25.610
you're truly a beauty of grace and refinement.

493
37:25.610 --> 37:27.210
You've completely outshone

494
37:27.210 --> 37:28.400
our Hanzhi.

495
37:28.480 --> 37:29.460
You flatter me.

496
37:30.150 --> 37:31.920
Bowen, please keep them company for a bit.

497
37:31.920 --> 37:33.130
I need to go get things ready.

498
37:33.130 --> 37:33.630
Excuse me.

499
37:33.630 --> 37:34.510
Go ahead.

500
37:34.710 --> 37:35.910
I'll take them over.

501
37:36.280 --> 37:36.910
Let's go.

502
37:36.980 --> 37:37.610
Miss Ye.

503
37:37.920 --> 37:39.780
Let's take our seats.

504
37:41.010 --> 37:42.190
Come on, Miss Ye.

505
37:43.880 --> 37:44.610
-Thank you. -This way, please.

506
37:44.610 --> 37:45.150
Please.

507
37:49.760 --> 37:50.880
Come on, Miss Ye.

508
37:51.090 --> 37:52.150
Please have a seat.

509
37:57.150 --> 37:58.420
Miss Ye, have a seat.

510
38:01.010 --> 38:02.260
I'm sorry, Bowen.

511
38:02.460 --> 38:03.650
I just remembered

512
38:03.650 --> 38:05.900
that I have to take my mother to the hospital for a checkup.

513
38:05.900 --> 38:07.110
So I can't stay for the meal.

514
38:07.110 --> 38:08.630
Would you like me to go with you?

515
38:08.630 --> 38:09.110
No need.

516
38:09.110 --> 38:09.860
Wait.

517
38:11.050 --> 38:11.820
What?

518
38:12.360 --> 38:13.560
The moment you see me,

519
38:13.630 --> 38:15.510
you scramble to leave?

520
38:16.360 --> 38:17.960
Am I some kind of monster?

521
38:19.880 --> 38:20.550
That's not

522
38:20.620 --> 38:22.260
how we treat guests in my home.

523
38:22.260 --> 38:23.050
Miss Ye,

524
38:23.170 --> 38:25.510
at least have something to eat before you go.

525
38:25.510 --> 38:26.500
-Yeah. -You know

526
38:26.820 --> 38:27.940
how difficult it is to get an appointment

527
38:27.940 --> 38:29.010
at a major hospital.

528
38:29.010 --> 38:30.150
If we miss it this time,

529
38:30.150 --> 38:32.010
who knows when we'll get another.

530
38:32.610 --> 38:33.460
That's easy.

531
38:34.420 --> 38:36.550
I'll have Director Gu send someone to the hospital.

532
38:36.550 --> 38:38.170
With his men standing guard at the door,

533
38:38.170 --> 38:40.050
the doctor will be sure to give your mother

534
38:40.050 --> 38:41.450
a thorough examination.

535
38:42.280 --> 38:43.960
There's no need for such a fuss.

536
38:43.960 --> 38:45.510
After the meal,

537
38:45.510 --> 38:47.110
I'll have a car take you home,

538
38:47.150 --> 38:48.150
pick up your mother,

539
38:48.150 --> 38:49.360
and then take you both to the hospital.

540
38:49.360 --> 38:50.860
You won't miss the appointment,

541
38:50.860 --> 38:52.190
so just relax and stay.

542
38:53.420 --> 38:54.780
-Come on, have a seat. -Come on.

543
38:54.780 --> 38:55.130
Sit down.

544
38:55.130 --> 38:56.010
-Come on. Have a seat. -Hanzhi.

545
38:56.010 --> 38:56.800
Come on, sit.

546
38:57.760 --> 38:58.420
Please sit.

547
38:58.960 --> 39:00.490
Let's enjoy the meal first.

548
39:00.610 --> 39:02.470
Yeah, since you're already here.

549
39:06.050 --> 39:07.710
Since everyone is here today,

550
39:08.030 --> 39:09.110
I have an important announcement

551
39:09.110 --> 39:09.690
to make.

552
39:12.860 --> 39:13.710
Miss Ye,

553
39:14.260 --> 39:15.720
the moment I saw you today,

554
39:16.000 --> 39:17.730
I took an instant liking to you.

555
39:17.960 --> 39:18.860
I thought to myself,

556
39:18.860 --> 39:20.860
how wonderful it would be if I could

557
39:20.980 --> 39:22.510
take you as my sworn sister.

558
39:22.760 --> 39:23.550
I wonder

559
39:23.650 --> 39:25.380
if you would do me the honor

560
39:25.460 --> 39:28.280
of accepting me as your older sister.

561
39:28.510 --> 39:29.440
Would you agree?

562
39:30.780 --> 39:32.850
I didn't expect Miss Ye and Bowen

563
39:32.960 --> 39:34.210
to hit it off so well.

564
39:35.280 --> 39:37.530
How could I possibly be worthy of such an honor?

565
39:37.530 --> 39:39.050
Not at all, not at all.

566
39:40.860 --> 39:41.530
Sister,

567
39:42.010 --> 39:43.590
here's a small gift to mark our first meeting.

568
39:43.590 --> 39:44.590
Please accept it.

569
39:47.780 --> 39:49.840
Bowen, that's quite a generous gift.

570
39:50.760 --> 39:52.660
Miss Ye is truly lucky!

571
39:52.680 --> 39:54.170
-Yes, she is. -Alright.

572
39:54.530 --> 39:55.860
From today on,

573
39:56.150 --> 39:56.840
Pingjun

574
39:57.090 --> 39:59.350
is the little sister of both Boren and me.

575
39:59.730 --> 40:02.570
If any of you dare to bully her,

576
40:03.420 --> 40:05.480
I will never let them get away with it.

577
40:06.110 --> 40:07.920
Since she's your sworn sister now,

578
40:07.920 --> 40:09.130
we can't cherish her enough.

579
40:09.130 --> 40:10.690
How could we have the heart to bully her?

580
40:10.690 --> 40:11.280
Good.

581
40:12.260 --> 40:13.820
In that case,

582
40:14.150 --> 40:15.460
if you think you can dote on my little sister

583
40:15.460 --> 40:16.280
without first treating

584
40:16.280 --> 40:18.140
Bowen and me to winter melon soup,

585
40:18.150 --> 40:19.090
you've got

586
40:19.090 --> 40:20.350
another thing coming.

587
40:20.460 --> 40:21.260
Cousin,

588
40:21.430 --> 40:23.110
you haven't had a drop, and you're already talking like you're drunk.

589
40:23.110 --> 40:24.260
Isn't winter melon soup

590
40:24.260 --> 40:24.670
for thanking

591
40:24.670 --> 40:25.630
the matchmaker?

592
40:26.150 --> 40:26.980
Is that so?

593
40:33.500 --> 40:34.320
Pingjun,

594
40:35.280 --> 40:36.080
a toast to you.

595
40:55.460 --> 40:56.920
Why just an ordinary toast?

596
40:56.920 --> 40:58.510
Link arms and drink like newlyweds!

597
40:58.510 --> 40:59.260
Exactly!

598
40:59.260 --> 41:00.390
Link arms and drink!

599
41:00.400 --> 41:01.360
Come on, link arms and drink!

600
41:01.360 --> 41:02.420
Stop teasing them!

601
41:05.460 --> 41:07.030
When you offer a toast, Brother,

602
41:07.030 --> 41:08.630
how could I possibly refuse?

603
41:11.510 --> 41:12.710
What did you just call me?

604
41:12.710 --> 41:14.110
Brother, of course.

605
41:15.010 --> 41:17.030
I'm the Li family's newly sworn sister.

606
41:17.030 --> 41:18.320
And since you and Mr. Li

607
41:18.320 --> 41:19.720
are as close as brothers,

608
41:20.050 --> 41:21.390
calling you "Brother"

609
41:21.920 --> 41:23.250
is only right, isn't it?

610
41:40.170 --> 41:41.230
Sorry, everyone.

611
41:41.440 --> 41:42.860
I really have something to take care of today.

612
41:42.860 --> 41:43.990
I'll head out first.

613
41:44.460 --> 41:45.460
I'm leaving too.

614
41:47.650 --> 41:50.450
I'm going that way anyway, so let me give you a ride.

615
41:54.780 --> 41:55.510
Let's go,

616
41:56.230 --> 41:57.050
Sister.

617
42:28.480 --> 42:30.340
This gold bracelet is a bit gaudy.

618
42:30.780 --> 42:32.190
It doesn't suit

619
42:32.480 --> 42:34.340
hands as lovely as yours, Sister.

620
42:36.110 --> 42:36.920
There were so many people today,

621
42:36.920 --> 42:38.120
so I couldn't refuse.

622
42:38.690 --> 42:39.510
I'll return it

623
42:40.000 --> 42:41.730
to Bowen the next time I see her.

624
42:42.630 --> 42:43.160
Ruitong,

625
42:44.130 --> 42:47.060
bring me the brocade box from the glove compartment.

626
42:52.800 --> 42:53.840
It's good that you're returning it.

627
42:53.840 --> 42:54.510
Wear mine.

628
42:57.070 --> 42:59.130
Don't try to take it off. It's for you.

629
42:59.260 --> 43:00.120
I don't want it.

630
43:00.400 --> 43:01.070
What?

631
43:01.510 --> 43:02.110
Is the bracelet

632
43:02.110 --> 43:04.170
going to bite your hand or something?

633
43:14.550 --> 43:15.710
I'm sorry, Fifth Young Master.

634
43:15.710 --> 43:16.340
I'm sorry.

635
43:30.300 --> 43:31.000
If you

636
43:31.000 --> 43:32.780
really want to give me something,

637
43:32.780 --> 43:34.070
why not give me the contract

638
43:34.070 --> 43:35.170
for the Xiangxi Hotel instead?

639
43:35.170 --> 43:35.960
Since you already know

640
43:35.960 --> 43:36.670
the assassination

641
43:36.670 --> 43:38.070
had nothing to do with me,

642
43:38.360 --> 43:39.320
our agreement

643
43:39.690 --> 43:41.620
can be terminated automatically.

644
43:41.670 --> 43:44.000
It's not that I don't want to give it to you.

645
43:47.000 --> 43:48.130
I just can't bear to.

646
43:49.300 --> 43:50.230
What do you mean?

647
43:54.070 --> 43:55.630
I find a woman like you

648
43:56.170 --> 43:57.500
genuinely intriguing.

649
43:58.570 --> 44:00.100
I've grown a bit fond of you.

650
44:03.630 --> 44:04.890
Fifth Young Master Yu,

651
44:04.980 --> 44:06.640
do you think I'd believe that?

652
44:09.300 --> 44:10.210
Just a moment ago,

653
44:10.210 --> 44:11.940
you were calling me "Brother,"

654
44:12.280 --> 44:14.680
and now it's "Fifth Young Master Yu" again.

655
44:14.940 --> 44:16.200
But it doesn't matter.

656
44:16.630 --> 44:17.830
Whatever you call me,

657
44:18.170 --> 44:19.300
I'm happy to hear it.

658
44:21.440 --> 44:22.340
Li Boren

659
44:22.380 --> 44:23.610
deliberately goaded Hanzhi

660
44:23.610 --> 44:24.760
into bringing me.

661
44:24.940 --> 44:27.070
Then Bowen took me as her sworn sister.

662
44:27.440 --> 44:29.170
And you, Fifth Young Master Yu,

663
44:29.300 --> 44:31.960
gave me a bracelet and declared your affection.

664
44:32.150 --> 44:33.550
What are you really up to?

665
44:34.980 --> 44:36.040
I already told you.

666
44:37.280 --> 44:38.230
I like you.

667
44:39.980 --> 44:41.040
I want to court you.

668
44:47.980 --> 44:49.180
My home is just ahead.

669
44:51.630 --> 44:53.960
I won't trouble you to take me any further.

670
45:09.110 --> 45:10.240
Fifth Young Master,

671
45:10.590 --> 45:10.940
she's just a girl

672
45:10.940 --> 45:12.280
from a humble family.

673
45:12.690 --> 45:13.920
I'm sure Second Young Lady Tao

674
45:13.920 --> 45:15.380
